ffc47ef" facs="#m-43e5e1d5-7bea-45ca-af34-a1e3b7bd1c5b" label="lyrics-like">W. Dé¬  grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-84db1235-3e07-4fb6-8080-4f053c3b0aa7" facs="#m-4f3958dd-592d-4d6c-87dc-f7161b0c8443" label="ambiguous">ti- as.</l><l xml:id="m-756d9f83-9b2a-443b-b1e6-9f01f6168fa2" facs="#m-f0564f9e-4641-4ff0-a39b-26e44e6102c6" label="text-like">H. — On feasts of the II class.</l><l xml:id="m-738191ba-6f4e-4951-9ef1-4805550f454e" facs="#m-15e7969b-def3-4a0b-bf73-0b1635ae16ec" label="text-like">At ist Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-ed520445-4019-4ec6-9454-43e36bfec649" facs="#m-12da08b8-8d69-4a67-a5fa-481cadf1ddbb" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-310b3a91-2e1b-4198-a116-12b64a38fccf" facs="#m-99e191d2-4fab-47ff-b76a-be453b92d19f" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-a9ccecce-57a3-4941-adc3-ce3554fefdd1" facs="#m-a5b73b1f-1121-4e71-a705-9756cab3ffc0" label="lyrics-like">Enedi-cá¬ mus Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-4342b169-fc04-449e-8b42-f6c5a3932c4b" facs="#m-c94c54f7-b748-4225-a69c-319f0375af20" label="ambiguous">mino.</l><l xml:id="m-f673386e-8020-40ed-ac31-454be8aa7c06" facs="#m-cc35c393-a13f-443e-9269-f36b95b0d39a" label="lyrics-like">K. Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-b40c050d-9207-4a04-b65c-1bcfba82af64" facs="#m-1a492583-28ba-4c3e-ad20-db180d585403" label="lyrics-like">ográ¬</l><l xml:id="m-87348732-1435-4962-9b96-95b3309f7945" facs="#m-521cc1cb-d7df-40f8-ae84-2ecf7fff4bd2" label="ambiguous">ti-as.</l><l xml:id="m-d6441166-fbef-4d9c-9b7c-3ea07d9f95d3" facs="#m-29b0e500-0158-460a-b8bf-441706bee491" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-53017e23-4cdf-452e-9c1d-c5555f81dbdb" facs="#m-f0e97464-7035-43b5-98ae-f9ba7bb094cf" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-5b9d79f2-56a7-4522-bcd6-eaf3a7446ded" facs="#m-1d88ded2-a217-4247-8a73-ee734a9a3b19" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-d3d669a2-524e-4e9f-96ba-4fca0ed2270a" facs="#m-2952962c-c92f-465d-ad1c-09b3da2d899e" label="lyrics-like">Ene- di-cá-mus Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-492e479d-999b-4a78-99df-4ebc9c77d40d" facs="#m-3ac81a5d-1d50-4d6a-a07e-aa2